{"id":"3af0cd796b55bbd7","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-split-fibration-category.md","title":"指定分裂及其严格保持函子","display":"df-split-fibration-category — 指定分裂及其严格保持函子","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-df-split-fibration-category","aliases":["16-df-split-fibration-category","Category of split fibrations"],"display":"df-split-fibration-category — 指定分裂及其严格保持函子","depends_on":["[[16-df-functor]]","[[16-df-category]]","[[16-df-split-fibration]]","[[16-df-grothendieck-construction]]","[[16-df-substitution-functor]]","[[16-df-grothendieck-total-category]]","[[16-thm-grothendieck]]","[[16-df-natural-transformation-definition]]"],"source":"Definition 1.7.1(ii), p. 73 (PDF 93); Definitions 1.10.5, Theorem 1.10.7, pp. 110–111 (PDF 130–131)","revision_date":"2026-10-20"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-split-fibration-category"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-split-fibration-category</span><span>Category of split fibrations</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-split-fibration-category — 指定分裂及其严格保持函子"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fc49efccd7348d66\" href=\"?note=fc49efccd7348d66\" title=\"16-df-functor\">16-df-functor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"25a281534aa42440\" href=\"?note=25a281534aa42440\" title=\"16-df-category\">16-df-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"eb3d8d8bfc151af6\" href=\"?note=eb3d8d8bfc151af6\" title=\"16-df-split-fibration\">16-df-split-fibration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"43c81e33a22655f0\" href=\"?note=43c81e33a22655f0\" title=\"16-df-grothendieck-construction\">16-df-grothendieck-construction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f12a7a1ec4908770\" href=\"?note=f12a7a1ec4908770\" title=\"16-df-substitution-functor\">16-df-substitution-functor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d8e49782eb81e5ab\" href=\"?note=d8e49782eb81e5ab\" title=\"16-df-grothendieck-total-category\">16-df-grothendieck-total-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"68817150a3172cfd\" href=\"?note=68817150a3172cfd\" title=\"16-thm-grothendieck\">16-thm-grothendieck</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"25140205ca0312de\" href=\"?note=25140205ca0312de\" title=\"16-df-natural-transformation-definition\">16-df-natural-transformation-definition</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Definition 1.7.1(ii), p. 73 (PDF 93); Definitions 1.10.5, Theorem 1.10.7, pp. 110–111 (PDF 130–131)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-20"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal B\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span> 为小范畴；在更大的宇宙 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal W\">\\(\\mathcal W\\)</span> 中构造以下两个范畴。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SplitFib}\">\\(\\mathrm{SplitFib}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StrictIndexed}\">\\(\\mathrm{StrictIndexed}\\)</span> 及所需函子运算采用所列直接依赖。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S=(\\mathcal E,p,\\kappa)\">\\(S=(\\mathcal E,p,\\kappa)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=(\\mathcal D,q,\\lambda)\">\\(T=(\\mathcal D,q,\\lambda)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U=(\\mathcal A,r,\\mu)\">\\(U=(\\mathcal A,r,\\mu)\\)</span> 为下文 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O_s\">\\(O_s\\)</span> 的元素。箭头的源靶均显式带标签；在固定 Hom 中省略标签。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha=(\\alpha_I)_{I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B}\">\\(\\alpha=(\\alpha_I)_{I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B}\\)</span> 为函子分量族。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_{\\mathcal B},R_{\\mathcal B}\">\\(G_{\\mathcal B},R_{\\mathcal B}\\)</span> 为下文构造的对应函子；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_I\">\\(H_I\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> 在纤维上的两个分量限制。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_S:\\mathbf C(p,\\kappa)\\to\\mathcal E\">\\(K_S:\\mathbf C(p,\\kappa)\\to\\mathcal E\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"d8e49782eb81e5ab\" href=\"?note=d8e49782eb81e5ab\" title=\"16-df-grothendieck-total-category\">16-df-grothendieck-total-category</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_I:(\\int F)_I\\to F(I)\">\\(T_I:(\\int F)_I\\to F(I)\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"68817150a3172cfd\" href=\"?note=68817150a3172cfd\" title=\"16-thm-grothendieck\">16-thm-grothendieck</a>；两者分别用于末行自然同构的分量。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cat}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cat}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Functor}\">\\(\\mathrm{Functor}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"25a281534aa42440\" href=\"?note=25a281534aa42440\" title=\"16-df-category\">16-df-category</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"fc49efccd7348d66\" href=\"?note=fc49efccd7348d66\" title=\"16-df-functor\">16-df-functor</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NatIso}_{\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D}(\\eta:F\\Rightarrow G)\">\\(\\mathrm{NatIso}_{\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D}(\\eta:F\\Rightarrow G)\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"25140205ca0312de\" href=\"?note=25140205ca0312de\" title=\"16-df-natural-transformation-definition\">16-df-natural-transformation-definition</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nO_s&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(\\mathcal E,p,\\kappa)\\mid\\mathcal E\\in\\mathcal V\n\\land\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathcal E)\\land\\mathrm{Functor}(p,\\mathcal E,\\mathcal B)\n\\land\\mathrm{SplitFib}(p,\\kappa)\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal H_s(S,T)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{H\\mid\\mathrm{Functor}(H,\\mathcal E,\\mathcal D)\n\\land qH=p\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land(\\forall I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\n(\\forall u:I\\to J)(\\forall Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_J)\\\nH\\kappa(u,Y)=\\lambda(u,HY)\\},\\\\\nM_s&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle S,T,H\\rangle\\mid S,T\\in O_s\\land H\\in\\mathcal H_s(S,T)\\},\\\\\ns_s\\langle S,T,H\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq S,\n\\qquad t_s\\langle S,T,H\\rangle\\coloneqq T,\\\\\ne_s(S)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle S,S,\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathcal E}\\rangle,\\\\\nc_s(\\langle T,U,K\\rangle,\\langle S,T,H\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle S,U,KH\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathbf{SplitFib}(\\mathcal B)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle O_s,M_s,s_s,t_s,e_s,c_s\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nO_s&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(\\mathcal E,p,\\kappa)\\mid\\mathcal E\\in\\mathcal V\n\\land\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathcal E)\\land\\mathrm{Functor}(p,\\mathcal E,\\mathcal B)\n\\land\\mathrm{SplitFib}(p,\\kappa)\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal H_s(S,T)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{H\\mid\\mathrm{Functor}(H,\\mathcal E,\\mathcal D)\n\\land qH=p\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land(\\forall I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\n(\\forall u:I\\to J)(\\forall Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_J)\\\nH\\kappa(u,Y)=\\lambda(u,HY)\\},\\\\\nM_s&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle S,T,H\\rangle\\mid S,T\\in O_s\\land H\\in\\mathcal H_s(S,T)\\},\\\\\ns_s\\langle S,T,H\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq S,\n\\qquad t_s\\langle S,T,H\\rangle\\coloneqq T,\\\\\ne_s(S)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle S,S,\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathcal E}\\rangle,\\\\\nc_s(\\langle T,U,K\\rangle,\\langle S,T,H\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle S,U,KH\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathbf{SplitFib}(\\mathcal B)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle O_s,M_s,s_s,t_s,e_s,c_s\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nO_i&amp;\\coloneqq\\{F\\in\\mathcal V\\mid\\mathrm{StrictIndexed}(F,\\mathcal B)\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal H_i(F,G)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\alpha\\mid\n(\\forall I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\\\n\\mathrm{Functor}(\\alpha_I,F(I),G(I))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land(\\forall I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\n(\\forall u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal B}(I,J))\\\n\\alpha_I F(u)=G(u)\\alpha_J\\},\\\\\nM_i&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle F,G,\\alpha\\rangle\\mid F,G\\in O_i\\land\\alpha\\in\\mathcal H_i(F,G)\\},\\\\\ns_i\\langle F,G,\\alpha\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq F,\n\\qquad t_i\\langle F,G,\\alpha\\rangle\\coloneqq G,\\\\\ne_i(F)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle F,F,(\\operatorname{Id}_{F(I)})_I\\rangle,\\\\\nc_i(\\langle G,H,\\beta\\rangle,\\langle F,G,\\alpha\\rangle)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle F,H,(\\beta_I\\alpha_I)_I\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathbf{ICat}(\\mathcal B)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle O_i,M_i,s_i,t_i,e_i,c_i\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nO_i&amp;\\coloneqq\\{F\\in\\mathcal V\\mid\\mathrm{StrictIndexed}(F,\\mathcal B)\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal H_i(F,G)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\alpha\\mid\n(\\forall I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\\\n\\mathrm{Functor}(\\alpha_I,F(I),G(I))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land(\\forall I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\n(\\forall u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal B}(I,J))\\\n\\alpha_I F(u)=G(u)\\alpha_J\\},\\\\\nM_i&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle F,G,\\alpha\\rangle\\mid F,G\\in O_i\\land\\alpha\\in\\mathcal H_i(F,G)\\},\\\\\ns_i\\langle F,G,\\alpha\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq F,\n\\qquad t_i\\langle F,G,\\alpha\\rangle\\coloneqq G,\\\\\ne_i(F)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle F,F,(\\operatorname{Id}_{F(I)})_I\\rangle,\\\\\nc_i(\\langle G,H,\\beta\\rangle,\\langle F,G,\\alpha\\rangle)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle F,H,(\\beta_I\\alpha_I)_I\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathbf{ICat}(\\mathcal B)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle O_i,M_i,s_i,t_i,e_i,c_i\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nG_{\\mathcal B}(F)&amp;\\coloneqq(\\textstyle\\int F,p_F,\\kappa_F),\\\\\nK_\\alpha(I,X)&amp;\\coloneqq(I,\\alpha_I X),\\\\\nK_\\alpha\\langle(I,X),(J,Y),u,f\\rangle\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle(I,\\alpha_I X),(J,\\alpha_JY),u,\\alpha_I f\\rangle,\\\\\nG_{\\mathcal B}\\langle F,G,\\alpha\\rangle\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle G_{\\mathcal B}F,G_{\\mathcal B}G,K_\\alpha\\rangle,\\\\\nR_{\\mathcal B}(S)_0(I)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathcal E_I,\n\\qquad R_{\\mathcal B}(S)_1(u)\\coloneqq u^*_{\\kappa},\\\\\nH_I&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle H_0\\upharpoonright\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I,\nH_1\\upharpoonright\\operatorname{Mor}\\mathcal E_I\\rangle,\\\\\nR_{\\mathcal B}\\langle S,T,H\\rangle\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle R_{\\mathcal B}S,R_{\\mathcal B}T,(H_I)_I\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nG_{\\mathcal B}(F)&amp;\\coloneqq(\\textstyle\\int F,p_F,\\kappa_F),\\\\\nK_\\alpha(I,X)&amp;\\coloneqq(I,\\alpha_I X),\\\\\nK_\\alpha\\langle(I,X),(J,Y),u,f\\rangle\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle(I,\\alpha_I X),(J,\\alpha_JY),u,\\alpha_I f\\rangle,\\\\\nG_{\\mathcal B}\\langle F,G,\\alpha\\rangle\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle G_{\\mathcal B}F,G_{\\mathcal B}G,K_\\alpha\\rangle,\\\\\nR_{\\mathcal B}(S)_0(I)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathcal E_I,\n\\qquad R_{\\mathcal B}(S)_1(u)\\coloneqq u^*_{\\kappa},\\\\\nH_I&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle H_0\\upharpoonright\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I,\nH_1\\upharpoonright\\operatorname{Mor}\\mathcal E_I\\rangle,\\\\\nR_{\\mathcal B}\\langle S,T,H\\rangle\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle R_{\\mathcal B}S,R_{\\mathcal B}T,(H_I)_I\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\nu_S&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle G_{\\mathcal B}R_{\\mathcal B}S,S,K_S\\rangle,\n\\qquad\\omega_F\\coloneqq\\langle R_{\\mathcal B}G_{\\mathcal B}F,F,(T_I)_I\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathbf{SplitFib}(\\mathcal B))&amp;,\n\\qquad\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathbf{ICat}(\\mathcal B)),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Functor}(G_{\\mathcal B},\\mathbf{ICat}(\\mathcal B),\\mathbf{SplitFib}(\\mathcal B))&amp;,\n\\qquad\\mathrm{Functor}(R_{\\mathcal B},\\mathbf{SplitFib}(\\mathcal B),\\mathbf{ICat}(\\mathcal B)),\\\\\n\\mathrm{NatIso}_{\\mathbf{SplitFib}(\\mathcal B),\\mathbf{SplitFib}(\\mathcal B)}(\\nu:G_{\\mathcal B}R_{\\mathcal B}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathbf{SplitFib}(\\mathcal B)})&amp;,\n\\qquad\\mathrm{NatIso}_{\\mathbf{ICat}(\\mathcal B),\\mathbf{ICat}(\\mathcal B)}(\\omega:R_{\\mathcal B}G_{\\mathcal B}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathbf{ICat}(\\mathcal B)}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\nu_S&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle G_{\\mathcal B}R_{\\mathcal B}S,S,K_S\\rangle,\n\\qquad\\omega_F\\coloneqq\\langle R_{\\mathcal B}G_{\\mathcal B}F,F,(T_I)_I\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathbf{SplitFib}(\\mathcal B))&amp;,\n\\qquad\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathbf{ICat}(\\mathcal B)),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Functor}(G_{\\mathcal B},\\mathbf{ICat}(\\mathcal B),\\mathbf{SplitFib}(\\mathcal B))&amp;,\n\\qquad\\mathrm{Functor}(R_{\\mathcal B},\\mathbf{SplitFib}(\\mathcal B),\\mathbf{ICat}(\\mathcal B)),\\\\\n\\mathrm{NatIso}_{\\mathbf{SplitFib}(\\mathcal B),\\mathbf{SplitFib}(\\mathcal B)}(\\nu:G_{\\mathcal B}R_{\\mathcal B}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathbf{SplitFib}(\\mathcal B)})&amp;,\n\\qquad\\mathrm{NatIso}_{\\mathbf{ICat}(\\mathcal B),\\mathbf{ICat}(\\mathcal B)}(\\omega:R_{\\mathcal B}G_{\\mathcal B}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathbf{ICat}(\\mathcal B)}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>对象是带指定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> 的三元组，不能只保留 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 的存在性质。严格保持所选箭头也保持其定义域，因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_Iu^*_{\\kappa}=u^*_{\\lambda}H_J\">\\(H_Iu^*_{\\kappa}=u^*_{\\lambda}H_J\\)</span>；箭头部分由笛卡尔唯一性严格相等。</li>\n<li>恒等与复合严格保持提升，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{SplitFib}\">\\(\\mathbf{SplitFib}\\)</span> 的运算封闭。分量函子的恒等、复合保持严格自然性，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{ICat}\">\\(\\mathbf{ICat}\\)</span> 的运算也封闭。两边范畴公理逐分量成立。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_\\alpha\">\\(K_\\alpha\\)</span> 的靶类型由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha_I F(u)=G(u)\\alpha_J\">\\(\\alpha_I F(u)=G(u)\\alpha_J\\)</span> 保证；该等式也保证严格保持分裂。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_{\\mathcal B}\">\\(R_{\\mathcal B}\\)</span> 的严格性由所选分裂保证。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu,\\omega\">\\(\\nu,\\omega\\)</span> 的分量分别是总范畴重建和纤维标签遗忘的同构；其逆来自这两页的显式逆函子，自然性逐对象和箭头计算成立。</li>\n<li>这是原书 Theorem 1.10.7 在固定基范畴上的普通范畴等价。没有由此推出“严格、分裂、一般纤维化”的两个包含都是 2-反射；一般纤维化的分裂替代见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"d384d77e035108ca\" href=\"?note=d384d77e035108ca\" title=\"16-thm-split-replacement\">16-thm-split-replacement</a>。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, Definition 1.7.1(ii), p. 73（PDF 93）；Definitions 1.10.5、Theorem 1.10.7, pp. 110–111（PDF 130–131）。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"fc49efccd7348d66","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"25a281534aa42440","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-split-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"eb3d8d8bfc151af6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-split-fibration]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-grothendieck-construction","status":"resolved","id":"43c81e33a22655f0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-grothendieck-construction]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-substitution-functor","status":"resolved","id":"f12a7a1ec4908770","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-substitution-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-grothendieck-total-category","status":"resolved","id":"d8e49782eb81e5ab","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-grothendieck-total-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-thm-grothendieck","status":"resolved","id":"68817150a3172cfd","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-thm-grothendieck]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-natural-transformation-definition","status":"resolved","id":"25140205ca0312de","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-natural-transformation-definition]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-grothendieck-total-category","status":"resolved","id":"d8e49782eb81e5ab","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$K_S:\\mathbf C(p,\\kappa)\\to\\mathcal E$ 采用 [[16-df-grothendieck-total-category]]，$T_I:(\\int F)_I\\to F(I)$ 采用 [[16-thm-grothendieck]]；两者分别用于末行自然同构的分量。","embed":false},{"target":"16-thm-grothendieck","status":"resolved","id":"68817150a3172cfd","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$K_S:\\mathbf C(p,\\kappa)\\to\\mathcal E$ 采用 [[16-df-grothendieck-total-category]]，$T_I:(\\int F)_I\\to F(I)$ 采用 [[16-thm-grothendieck]]；两者分别用于末行自然同构的分量。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"25a281534aa42440","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cat}$、$\\mathrm{Functor}$ 采用 [[16-df-category]]、[[16-df-functor]]；$\\mathrm{NatIso}_{\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D}(\\eta:F\\Rightarrow G)$ 采用 [[16-df-natural-transformation-definition]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"fc49efccd7348d66","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cat}$、$\\mathrm{Functor}$ 采用 [[16-df-category]]、[[16-df-functor]]；$\\mathrm{NatIso}_{\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D}(\\eta:F\\Rightarrow G)$ 采用 [[16-df-natural-transformation-definition]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-natural-transformation-definition","status":"resolved","id":"25140205ca0312de","anchor":"ref-13","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cat}$、$\\mathrm{Functor}$ 采用 [[16-df-category]]、[[16-df-functor]]；$\\mathrm{NatIso}_{\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D}(\\eta:F\\Rightarrow G)$ 采用 [[16-df-natural-transformation-definition]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-thm-split-replacement","status":"resolved","id":"d384d77e035108ca","anchor":"ref-14","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"这是原书 Theorem 1.10.7 在固定基范畴上的普通范畴等价。没有由此推出“严格、分裂、一般纤维化”的两个包含都是 2-反射；一般纤维化的分裂替代见 [[16-thm-split-replacement]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal B\\in\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal W","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SplitFib}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StrictIndexed}","display":false},{"tex":"S=(\\mathcal E,p,\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"T=(\\mathcal D,q,\\lambda)","display":false},{"tex":"U=(\\mathcal A,r,\\mu)","display":false},{"tex":"O_s","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha=(\\alpha_I)_{I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B}","display":false},{"tex":"G_{\\mathcal B},R_{\\mathcal B}","display":false},{"tex":"H_I","display":false},{"tex":"H","display":false},{"tex":"K_S:\\mathbf C(p,\\kappa)\\to\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"T_I:(\\int F)_I\\to F(I)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cat}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Functor}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NatIso}_{\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D}(\\eta:F\\Rightarrow G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nO_s&\\coloneqq\\{(\\mathcal E,p,\\kappa)\\mid\\mathcal E\\in\\mathcal V\n\\land\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathcal E)\\land\\mathrm{Functor}(p,\\mathcal E,\\mathcal B)\n\\land\\mathrm{SplitFib}(p,\\kappa)\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal H_s(S,T)&\\coloneqq\\{H\\mid\\mathrm{Functor}(H,\\mathcal E,\\mathcal D)\n\\land qH=p\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land(\\forall I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\n(\\forall u:I\\to J)(\\forall Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_J)\\\nH\\kappa(u,Y)=\\lambda(u,HY)\\},\\\\\nM_s&\\coloneqq\\{\\langle S,T,H\\rangle\\mid S,T\\in O_s\\land H\\in\\mathcal H_s(S,T)\\},\\\\\ns_s\\langle S,T,H\\rangle&\\coloneqq S,\n\\qquad t_s\\langle S,T,H\\rangle\\coloneqq T,\\\\\ne_s(S)&\\coloneqq\\langle S,S,\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathcal E}\\rangle,\\\\\nc_s(\\langle T,U,K\\rangle,\\langle S,T,H\\rangle)&\\coloneqq\\langle S,U,KH\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathbf{SplitFib}(\\mathcal B)&\\coloneqq\\langle O_s,M_s,s_s,t_s,e_s,c_s\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nO_i&\\coloneqq\\{F\\in\\mathcal V\\mid\\mathrm{StrictIndexed}(F,\\mathcal B)\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal H_i(F,G)&\\coloneqq\\{\\alpha\\mid\n(\\forall I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\\\n\\mathrm{Functor}(\\alpha_I,F(I),G(I))\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land(\\forall I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\n(\\forall u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal B}(I,J))\\\n\\alpha_I F(u)=G(u)\\alpha_J\\},\\\\\nM_i&\\coloneqq\\{\\langle F,G,\\alpha\\rangle\\mid F,G\\in O_i\\land\\alpha\\in\\mathcal H_i(F,G)\\},\\\\\ns_i\\langle F,G,\\alpha\\rangle&\\coloneqq F,\n\\qquad t_i\\langle F,G,\\alpha\\rangle\\coloneqq G,\\\\\ne_i(F)&\\coloneqq\\langle F,F,(\\operatorname{Id}_{F(I)})_I\\rangle,\\\\\nc_i(\\langle G,H,\\beta\\rangle,\\langle F,G,\\alpha\\rangle)\n&\\coloneqq\\langle F,H,(\\beta_I\\alpha_I)_I\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathbf{ICat}(\\mathcal B)&\\coloneqq\\langle O_i,M_i,s_i,t_i,e_i,c_i\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nG_{\\mathcal B}(F)&\\coloneqq(\\textstyle\\int F,p_F,\\kappa_F),\\\\\nK_\\alpha(I,X)&\\coloneqq(I,\\alpha_I X),\\\\\nK_\\alpha\\langle(I,X),(J,Y),u,f\\rangle\n&\\coloneqq\\langle(I,\\alpha_I X),(J,\\alpha_JY),u,\\alpha_I f\\rangle,\\\\\nG_{\\mathcal B}\\langle F,G,\\alpha\\rangle\n&\\coloneqq\\langle G_{\\mathcal B}F,G_{\\mathcal B}G,K_\\alpha\\rangle,\\\\\nR_{\\mathcal B}(S)_0(I)&\\coloneqq\\mathcal E_I,\n\\qquad R_{\\mathcal B}(S)_1(u)\\coloneqq u^*_{\\kappa},\\\\\nH_I&\\coloneqq\\langle H_0\\upharpoonright\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I,\nH_1\\upharpoonright\\operatorname{Mor}\\mathcal E_I\\rangle,\\\\\nR_{\\mathcal B}\\langle S,T,H\\rangle\n&\\coloneqq\\langle R_{\\mathcal B}S,R_{\\mathcal B}T,(H_I)_I\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\nu_S&\\coloneqq\\langle G_{\\mathcal B}R_{\\mathcal B}S,S,K_S\\rangle,\n\\qquad\\omega_F\\coloneqq\\langle R_{\\mathcal B}G_{\\mathcal B}F,F,(T_I)_I\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathbf{SplitFib}(\\mathcal B))&,\n\\qquad\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathbf{ICat}(\\mathcal B)),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Functor}(G_{\\mathcal B},\\mathbf{ICat}(\\mathcal B),\\mathbf{SplitFib}(\\mathcal B))&,\n\\qquad\\mathrm{Functor}(R_{\\mathcal B},\\mathbf{SplitFib}(\\mathcal B),\\mathbf{ICat}(\\mathcal B)),\\\\\n\\mathrm{NatIso}_{\\mathbf{SplitFib}(\\mathcal B),\\mathbf{SplitFib}(\\mathcal B)}(\\nu:G_{\\mathcal B}R_{\\mathcal B}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathbf{SplitFib}(\\mathcal B)})&,\n\\qquad\\mathrm{NatIso}_{\\mathbf{ICat}(\\mathcal B),\\mathbf{ICat}(\\mathcal B)}(\\omega:R_{\\mathcal B}G_{\\mathcal B}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathbf{ICat}(\\mathcal B)}).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"H_Iu^*_{\\kappa}=u^*_{\\lambda}H_J","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{SplitFib}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{ICat}","display":false},{"tex":"K_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha_I F(u)=G(u)\\alpha_J","display":false},{"tex":"R_{\\mathcal B}","display":false},{"tex":"\\nu,\\omega","display":false}],"bytes":6077,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-339","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-split-fibration-category|df-split-fibration-category — 指定分裂及其严格保持函子]]"},{"id":"4dcb60fd80f242a0","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\bar p=(\\mathcal E,p,\\kappa_p)$、$\\bar q=(\\mathcal D,q,\\kappa_q)$、$\\bar r=(\\mathcal R,r,\\kappa_r)$ 为 [[16-df-split-fibration-category]] 的 $\\mathbf{SplitFib}(\\mathcal B)$ 对象；该记号保留分裂选择。$\\mathrm{Functor}$ 与 $\\mathrm{IsoFunctor}$、$\\mathrm{NatTrans}$ 使用 [[16-df-natural-transformation-definition]] 的精确接口。$\\operatorname{IFun}(C,D)$、$\\operatorname{SF}_{\\mathcal B}(\\bar p,\\bar q)$ 按下文的六元组构造；只有在已固定同一分裂时才省略横线。"},{"id":"68817150a3172cfd","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"本页是 Proposition 1.10.2 的严格实例；Theorem 1.10.7 所述完整对应的固定基范畴接口见 [[16-df-split-fibration-category]]。"},{"id":"d384d77e035108ca","anchor":"ref-17","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"来源：Jacobs, Lemma 5.2.4、Corollary 5.2.5, pp. 323–324（PDF 343–344）。固定基范畴的 split/indexed 对应另见 [[16-df-split-fibration-category]]。"}],"outgoing":["fc49efccd7348d66","25a281534aa42440","eb3d8d8bfc151af6","43c81e33a22655f0","f12a7a1ec4908770","d8e49782eb81e5ab","68817150a3172cfd","25140205ca0312de","d384d77e035108ca"]}